  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have been trained to use Dial kits, gaining the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Wisdom, Charisma, or Intelligence score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li>You gain proficiency in Dial kit, or expertise if you were already proficient.</li><li>Choose 2 Tricks from either the Bard, Medic, or Gadgeteer subclass. These tricks are added to any creation list you may have.</li><li>Choose one 1st level creation from the same list. You can use it once per long rest without expending a creation slot. Also added to your creation list.</li></ul>",
